    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（重甲），非普通（需同調）</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.o9GQEt4fYw6WjpB0]{死者交談 Speak with Dead}</em>或是<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.xYpJGRI4xcMa41kO]{活化死屍 Animate Dead}</em>。以此施展了法術後，直到次日黎明爲止這套護甲都無法再次被用於施展這兩個法術。<br />這套盔甲會隨着你靈魂的離去而消逝。若你在同調這套護甲期間死亡，這套護甲也將隨之摧毀。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span class=\"GramE\">該護甲</span>主要由<span class=\"GramE\">鉚接着</span>豎直金屬窄條的皮革內裏組成，其整體覆蓋在布料衣物外，而關節部位則由靈活<span class=\"GramE\">的鍊甲部件</span>提供保護。</p></div></div><p>While wearing this armor, you can use it to cast either @spell[Speak with Dead] or @spell[Animate Dead]. Once the armor has cast a spell in this way, it can't cast either spell until the next dawn.</p><p>Your soul keeps this armor together. If you die while you are attuned to the armor, the armor is destroyed.</p><p>This armor is made of narrow vertical strips of metal riveted to a backing of leather that is worn over cloth padding. Flexible chain mail protects the joints.</p></div>",
